Phase 4
Authority review and start work
33 authority reviews information of the complaints, starting from the title category, description address
34 authority reviews evidence available also sees if there was potential duplication of the complain or not. If there were duplication, it shows that many people have reported this complain, so it is urgent. 35. Authority starts the work by assigning a contractor, giving the contractors phone number, putting a deadline, giving an estimated budget, and with an optional initial work note. 36. The word starts and the word history is noted in authority, resident and admin side 37. The status of the complaint is exchanged from pending to in progress, and this status is visible in all sides
